INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (13,9,1,'shearoots-body-butter','Shearoots Body Butter','A nourishing, nature-rooted blend of coconut, olive, and sweet almond oils that melts into the skin with silky ease. Sandalwood calms, aloe vera soothes, arrowroot keeps it light, and vitamin E protects. A soft fragrance completes this smooth, everyday glow ritual.',1,'2025-11-27 05:41:06','2026-01-12 18:01:27'),(14,11,1,'red-wine-shampoo','Red Wine Shampoo','A refreshing, antioxidant-rich cleanse powered by gentle surfactants and the goodness of red wine. It washes away buildup without stripping your strands, while glycerin and panthenol lock in moisture for a soft, healthy bounce. The formula glides through your hair with a creamy lather, leaving it clean, nourished, and faintly perfumed — like a quiet luxury moment for your everyday wash.',1,'2025-11-27 05:55:39','2026-01-12 18:01:36'),(15,10,1,'goat-milk-moisturizing-soap','Goat Milk Moisturizing Soap','For 3years and above \"NOT TEAR FREE\"  A gentle, creamy bar crafted with the old-world goodness of goat milk and nourishing plant oils. Coconut, palm, and sunflower oils cleanse without stripping, while goat milk brings that soft, milky comfort your skin instantly drinks in. Each wash leaves your skin calm, hydrated, and lightly scented — a simple, timeless cleanse made for modern days.',1,'2025-11-27 06:10:54','2026-01-13 10:17:47'),(16,7,2,'sweet-lips-lip-balm-tinted','Sweet Lips Lip Balm Tinted','A buttery, melt-on-contact blend crafted to keep your lips soft the way old remedies always promised. Coconut and castor oils sink in deep, shea butter seals the moisture, and beeswax gives that natural shield against dryness. Vitamin E steps in as the quiet hero, keeping your lips nourished, smooth, and ready for the day. Finished with a lip-safe flavor and tint, it’s your everyday pocket ritual for soft, healthy, kiss-ready lips.',1,'2025-11-27 06:14:58','2026-02-06 15:05:57'),(17,10,1,'trio-clay-soap','Trio Clay Soap','For 3years and above \"NOT TEAR FREE\" A detoxifying, skin-loving bar powered by the perfect trio of white kaolin clay, pink clay, and activated charcoal. Blended with nourishing coconut, palm, sunflower, and olive oils, it cleanses deeply without drying, drawing out impurities while keeping the skin soft and balanced. Each wash feels earthy, refreshing, and subtly fragrant — a simple ritual that leaves your skin renewed and clear.',1,'2025-11-27 06:33:19','2026-01-13 10:17:08'),(22,8,1,'herbal-hair-boost-oil','Herbal Hair Boost Oil','A rich, traditional blend of nourishing oils infused with powerful botanicals trusted for generations. Bhringraj, rosemary, onion, and fenugreek work together to strengthen roots and support healthy growth, while aloe vera and henna soothe and condition the scalp. Vetiver, tea tree, and cedarwood add a purifying, calming touch, making each application a grounding ritual that leaves your hair feeling revived, nourished, and full of life.',1,'2025-11-28 05:11:10','2026-01-12 18:02:24'),(23,7,3,'sweet-lips-lip-balm-test','Sweet Lips Lip Balm(Test)','(TEST) A buttery, melt-on-contact blend crafted to keep your lips soft the way old remedies always promised. Coconut and castor oils sink in deep, shea butter seals the moisture, and beeswax gives that natural shield against dryness. Vitamin E steps in as the quiet hero, keeping your lips nourished, smooth, and ready for the day. Finished with a lip-safe flavor and tint, it’s your everyday pocket ritual for soft, healthy, kiss-ready lips.',0,'2025-11-29 07:54:39','2026-01-29 18:30:38'),(24,7,2,'sweet-lips-lip-balm','Sweet Lips Lip Balm','A buttery, melt-on-contact blend crafted to keep your lips soft the way old remedies always promised. Coconut and castor oils sink in deep, shea butter seals the moisture, and beeswax gives that natural shield against dryness. Vitamin E steps in as the quiet hero, keeping your lips nourished, smooth, and ready for the day. Finished with a lip-safe flavor, it’s your everyday pocket ritual for soft, healthy, kiss-ready lips.',1,'2026-02-06 14:59:18','2026-02-06 15:06:51'),(25,9,2,'shearoots-kids-body-butter','Shearoots kids  Body Butter ','A nourishing, nature-rooted blend of coconut, olive, and sweet almond oils that melts into the skin with silky ease. Sandalwood calms, aloe vera soothes, arrowroot keeps it light, and vitamin E protects. Thoughtfully crafted fragrance-free for delicate kids’ skin and gentle everyday care.',1,'2026-05-15 09:34:14','2026-05-15 09:55:00'),(26,10,2,'goat-milk-soap-teddy-bear','Goatmilk soap - Teady Bear','Gentle care for soft, healthy skin. Our Goat Milk Moisturizing Soap is handcrafted using the traditional cold process method to preserve natural glycerin and skin-loving nutrients. Enriched with goat milk goodness, it deeply moisturizes, helps prevent dryness, and leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and nourished. Perfect for sensitive skin and everyday use.',1,'2026-05-15 14:25:09','2026-05-16 04:07:53'),(27,10,2,'goat-milk-soap-butterfly','Goat milk soap - Butterfly ','Gentle care for soft, healthy skin. Our Goat Milk Moisturizing Soap is handcrafted using the traditional cold process method to preserve natural glycerin and skin-loving nutrients. Enriched with goat milk goodness, it deeply moisturizes, helps prevent dryness, and leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and nourished. Perfect for sensitive skin and everyday use.\n',1,'2026-05-15 14:31:35','2026-05-16 04:08:04'),(28,10,2,'glow-herb-120','Glow Herb Bath Powder ','Glow Herb Bath Powder \nExperience the perfect blend of traditional herbs and modern gentle cleansing. U&I Glow Herb Bath Powder is enriched with Kuppaimeni, Avarampoo, Rose Petals, Vetiver, Poolankizhangu, and Licorice and many other herbs along with mild plant-derived cleanser to provide a soft, creamy lather that effectively removes dirt, sweat, and excess oil without drying the skin.\n\nThis gentle formula cleanses, refreshes, and nourishes your skin while helping maintain its natural moisture. Suitable for both face and body, it leaves your skin feeling soft, smooth, refreshed, and naturally radiant after every bath.',1,'2026-07-15 14:20:47','2026-07-18 16:33:52'),(29,9,2,'butter-soft-body-lotion','Butter soft Body Lotion','Deep Moisture. Silky Soft Skin. Everyday Comfort. - Fragrenc\n\nGive your skin the care it deserves with U&I Naturals Butter Soft Body Lotion—a luxurious blend of nature\'s finest moisturizers crafted to deliver long-lasting hydration and everyday softness. Infused with the nourishing goodness of Shea Butter, Kokum Butter, Sunflower Seed Oil, Glycerin, and Vitamin E, this lightweight lotion melts effortlessly into the skin, providing deep nourishment without leaving a greasy residue.\n\nDesigned for both kids and adults, it helps keep skin feeling smooth, supple, and comfortably moisturized throughout the day. Whether you\'re starting your morning or winding down at night, Butter Soft Body Lotion leaves your skin irresistibly soft, healthy-looking, and beautifully cared for.\n\n',1,'2026-07-29 14:47:04','2026-08-26 17:14:11');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `products` ENABLE KEYS */;
