INSERT INTO `reviews` VALUES (15,16,28,5,NULL,'This lipbalm moisturizes the lips well  without feeling sticky and the fragrance is nice which is a good thing and as it\'s tinted it gives a light pink tint to lips.  A must buy in my opinion.','[]',0,NULL,'2026-01-16 15:25:17','2026-01-16 15:25:17'),(16,15,2,5,NULL,'Good Product.  Skin feels smooth and moisturized.','[]',0,NULL,'2026-01-17 07:33:03','2026-01-17 07:33:03'),(17,22,10,5,NULL,'The oil has a soothing herbal fragrance and a rich, smooth texture. A great purchase.','[]',0,NULL,'2026-01-21 05:42:51','2026-01-21 05:42:51'),(18,13,2,5,NULL,'SheaRoots Body Butter is thick, natural, and keeps your skin soft and moisturized for a long time without feeling oily.','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1769709171766-r-c48b9c707a6f38f6638c8713-14339.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2026-01-29 17:52:59','2026-01-29 17:52:59'),(20,13,38,5,NULL,'Body butter is really good....my daughter having dry skin,can see difference after using this....','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1769857854576-r-bf3f54d246276cd3b03a03c1-1000055208.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2026-01-31 11:11:08','2026-01-31 11:11:08'),(21,15,38,5,NULL,'Really this soap is working on me... after using this soap my skin is very soft and feeling refreshed ','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1769934726402-r-657ca50984c494e1f20010e6-1000055316.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2026-02-01 08:32:16','2026-02-01 08:32:16'),(22,13,NULL,5,NULL,'After applying this body butter, there is no itching and no dryness. The hydration is long lasting. I really love it','[]',1,'Kavitha M','2026-02-03 14:05:29','2026-02-03 14:05:29'),(23,14,NULL,5,NULL,'This shampoo makes my dry hair soft after every wash. I can feel the softness while washing itself.','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/products%2Fimages%2F1770179918559-b5fd53577189ee84d7f8c705-1000012910.webp\"]',1,'Pooja N ','2026-02-04 04:38:55','2026-02-04 04:38:55'),(24,13,NULL,5,NULL,'My child’s dry patches improved visibly after using this body butter. One application in the morning is enough for the whole day. That itself shows the quality.','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/products%2Fimages%2F1770181195828-3eff493896a4d037f09bae91-1000012904.webp\"]',1,'Lakshmi R','2026-02-04 05:00:35','2026-02-04 05:00:35'),(25,13,NULL,5,NULL,'I follow Dr Sudhakar sir regularly, so I trusted this product. As expected, it didn’t disappoint. It is safe for kids, excellent for dry skin, and very effective','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/products%2Fimages%2F1770192692965-a1a8c4eaa1c7b21c4dda6afe-1000012896.webp\"]',1,'Pradeep M','2026-02-04 08:11:57','2026-02-04 08:11:57'),(26,13,104,5,NULL,'This product is really amazing. We can confidently use it for babies. My baby’s skin has become very soft, and after using this for two weeks, the skin looks brighter too. It’s a truly useful product.\r\nSudhakar sir, please bring more products for babies like this. We trust you so much that we can buy your products with our eyes closed. Thank you so much, doctor. I’m very happy that my baby is using natural products.','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1770207971248-r-e5b600a57cc4e5fa47bc1fb7-1000132039.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2026-02-04 12:26:20','2026-02-04 12:26:20'),(27,13,97,5,NULL,'commenting here after using this product for 2 weeks. very nice product, fragrance is awesome, it is blending in skin very smoothly. definitely going to use this for long time.','[]',0,NULL,'2026-02-05 06:16:23','2026-02-05 06:16:23'),(28,16,97,5,NULL,'long lasting. very nice product','[]',0,NULL,'2026-02-05 06:17:22','2026-02-05 06:17:22'),(29,13,125,5,NULL,'I am using this for my preterm baby. The cream is really super i bought third bottle for my girl baby it blends smooth and keeps baby skin hydrated soft and supple with pleasant fragrance keep going mam awaiting for your more products for babies we can use the product without any doubt. U&I products are more better than the other product with chemicals available in market for babies. ','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1770299495349-r-b0ec9caaffc22142faf69c59-Screenshot_20260131_142220.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2026-02-05 13:51:38','2026-02-05 13:51:38'),(30,14,125,5,NULL,'Very nice shampoo makes hair so soft nd shiny after first wash itself so nice ','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1770695908842-r-86f0a4a0c93ba41cb799f179-17706958643667203800676887907552.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2026-02-10 03:58:38','2026-02-10 03:58:38'),(31,13,116,5,NULL,'This body butter is very much suitable for daily use as moisturizer from kids to elders in home. Giving instant cooling effect after applying with unique fragrance ☺️','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1776304947432-r-b4e04a36e66c63daec8521df-1000618179.jpg\", \"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1776304946537-r-7495bc42f0d64237560cf03b-1000618180.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2026-04-16 02:02:52','2026-04-16 02:02:52'),(32,22,NULL,5,NULL,'I bought my 1st bottle from the clinic and my 2nd from the website. I really like the earthy herbal smell, it feels so natural 😍 Just a small amount itself keeps my hair comfortable without drying 👍','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/products%2Fimages%2F1776318126064-b6c61c634c92b1a75ad65fa9-1000019730.webp\"]',1,'Vennila ','2026-04-16 05:42:22','2026-04-16 05:42:22'),(33,16,251,5,NULL,'Woww product this is , because \r\n*\"My lips actually feel soft all day with this\"* - Doesn\'t just sit on top. It sinks in and fixes the dryness.\r\n*\"Love that it\'s homemade but works better than store stuff\"* - No chemicals, no fake scent, just smooth lips.\r\n. *\"This balm saved my lips this winter\"* - Light, not sticky.','[]',0,NULL,'2026-06-09 16:54:17','2026-06-09 16:54:17'),(34,15,251,5,NULL,'\r\n\r\n*\"Gentle enough for my baby\'s skin\"* - No rash, no dryness after bath time. If it’s safe for them.\r\n *\"Finally a soap I can use on my baby + myself\"* - No harsh chemicals, just soft clean skin for both of us. Bath time stress = gone.\r\n*\"Mild enough for baby skin, creamy enough for me\"* - We’ve been using this bar for 4 weeks and no complaints from the little one.','[]',0,NULL,'2026-06-09 16:57:50','2026-06-09 16:57:50'),(35,15,NULL,5,NULL,'“Very gentle on baby’s skin”\nI’ve been using this moisturizing baby soap for my newborn, and it’s been great. It cleans well without drying out the skin, and there’s no redness or irritation.','[]',1,'Kalaimathi','2026-06-04 00:00:00','2026-06-14 18:18:03'),(36,15,NULL,5,NULL,'Great product...My baby had slight dry patches on the arms, and after using this moisturizing soap regularly, the skin looks much better and softer.','[]',1,'Kavithayini','2026-06-12 00:00:00','2026-06-14 18:20:02'),(37,27,NULL,5,NULL,'Awesome product... It has a very light, pleasant smell that isn’t overpowering. The soap feels safe and chemical-free, which is exactly what I wanted for my baby.','[]',1,'Kamalwsh','2026-06-08 00:00:00','2026-06-14 18:22:39'),(38,24,NULL,5,NULL,'This lip balm worked almost immediately. My lips felt less dry and cracked after just a few uses. It’s smooth, non-sticky, and comfortable to wear all day.','[]',1,'Arjun','2026-06-13 00:00:00','2026-06-14 18:23:49'),(39,24,NULL,5,NULL,'I’ve used this in both hot and cold weather, and it performs consistently. It protects my lips from getting dry, especially in air-conditioned rooms.','[]',1,'Ananya','2026-06-13 00:00:00','2026-06-14 18:24:35'),(40,22,NULL,5,NULL,'I’ve been using this herbal oil for a few weeks and it feels very natural on the skin. It absorbs nicely and gives a calming effect after application.','[]',1,'Hariharan','2026-06-10 00:00:00','2026-06-14 18:25:33'),(41,22,NULL,5,NULL,'The herbal scent is very mild and relaxing, not overpowering at all. I like using it before bedtime as it feels calming.','[]',1,'Kanishka','2026-06-14 00:00:00','2026-06-14 18:26:07'),(42,14,NULL,5,NULL,'Amazing product...My scalp tends to get oily quickly, but this shampoo helps control oil for a good couple of days. Hair feels fresh and light after washing.','[]',1,'Maheshwari ','2026-06-01 00:00:00','2026-06-14 18:27:38'),(43,14,NULL,5,NULL,'Amazing product...It’s not a miracle product, but it does its job well. Cleans properly, doesn’t cause hair fall for me, and is decent for regular use.','[]',1,'Balaji balaji','2026-06-06 00:00:00','2026-06-14 18:28:21'),(44,13,NULL,5,NULL,'Awesome product...Provides intense hydration for dry and rough skin.','[]',1,'Kowsalya ','2026-06-15 00:00:00','2026-06-15 16:53:53'),(45,13,NULL,5,NULL,'Helps protect the skin from dryness caused by weather and environmental factors.','[]',1,'Selva Kumar ','2026-06-06 00:00:00','2026-06-15 16:54:51'),(46,26,251,5,NULL,'Such a wonderful product, best for baby skin ..i would like to buy everytime ...bcoz the results after using this product was awesome 💯.....exact product for baby skins ...thank you mam','[]',0,NULL,'2026-07-03 02:11:28','2026-07-03 02:11:28'),(47,14,251,5,NULL,'I\'ve been using this product for a month. I\'ve noticed that my hair fall has decreased and I\'m also seeing new baby hair growth. My scalp is very clean and clear as well, which is really nice. 💯 And smell is very nice 🙂','[]',0,NULL,'2026-07-03 02:17:08','2026-07-03 02:17:08'),(48,25,251,5,NULL,'\r\nI Love this product..it gentle and nourishing this is. Melts right in and keeps my little one’s skin so soft. The fragrance-free formula is perfect for sensitive skin.','[]',0,NULL,'2026-07-03 02:23:00','2026-07-03 02:23:00'),(49,29,264,5,NULL,'Body Lotion is Lightweight, non-greasy, and intensely hydrating. It keeps dryness away all day with zero stickiness.','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1788322864098-r-9dbc5cf58a2e27cc853e925d-110131.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2026-09-02 04:21:17','2026-09-02 04:21:17'),(50,26,273,5,NULL,'This Soap keeps my baby soft all day. Leaves skin feeling like it already has lotion on—10/10 recommend!','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1791517848203-r-b3acaaebdefdd505149e282d-1000162085.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2026-10-09 03:50:52','2026-10-09 03:50:52'),(51,16,276,5,NULL,'Finally, a lip balm that actually lasts.\r\nI have used lip balms like Dermaco and Wishcare before and the problem was always the same: constant reapplying and after a while my lips would turn dry and powdery again. U&i Sweet Lips is a completely different experience. One application in the morning and my lips stayed soft, smooth and hydrated all day, with no dry patches and no chalky feel.  The small 6g tub is also easy to carry. Honestly, this is the best lip balm I have used and I am not going back. Highly recommended!!!','[\"https://pub-25688779f5b34d7a87524a48c1772ab6.r2.dev/reviews%2F1792300644292-r-22309be9a1f127bde22a302d-1000251474.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2026-10-18 05:17:26','2026-10-18 05:17:26');
